d PK\\n        BIGINT user_id FK\\n        VARCHAR report_name\\n        VARCHAR report_type\\n        VARCHAR file_path\\n        TIMESTAMP generated_at\\n    }\\n\\n    CHAT_HISTORY {\\n        BIGINT id PK\\n        BIGINT user_id FK\\n        TEXT question\\n        LONGTEXT answer\\n        TIMESTAMP created_at\\n    }\\n```\\n````\\n\\n## Relationships\\n\\n- **USERS → DOCUMENTS** = One-to-Many\\n- **USERS → REPORTS** = One-to-Many\\n- **USERS → CHAT_HISTORY** = One-to-Many\\n- **DOCUMENTS → DOCUMENT_ANALYSIS** = One-to-One\\n\\n### Why this design?\\n\\nThis database is normalized to **Third Normal Form (3NF)** and provides a clean foundation for the college project while remaining extensible for future features such as inventory, GST analytics, multi-company support, and team collaboration without major schema changes.\",\"role\",\"assistant\",{},{\"_255\":259,\"_262\":328,\"_35\":329,\"_266\":330,\"_268\":269,\"_271\":331,\"_273\":332,\"_275\":276},\"e159386c-3805-4bc7-82cf-c449bcfacddf\",[62],{\"_322\":336,\"_273\":337},1785742066.3793333,{\"_317\":318,\"_319\":334},0,{\"_296\":297,\"_298\":299,\"_300\":301,\"_302\":301,\"_303\":289,\"_47\":48,\"_305\":326,\"_306\":10,\"_333\":26,\"_304\":14},\"is_visually_hidden_from_conversation\",[335],\"\",\"system\",{},{\"_255\":326,\"_262\":341,\"_35\":342,\"_266\":343,\"_268\":269,\"_270\":26,\"_271\":331,\"_273\":344,\"_275\":276},\"bbb211c7-df39-4d89-aca2-1cfbb906c437\",[259],{\"_322\":336,\"_273\":349},1785742067.304693,{\"_317\":318,\"_319\":348},{\"_345\":346,\"_333\":26,\"_347\":14,\"_296\":297,\"_298\":299,\"_300\":301,\"_302\":301,\"_303\":289,\"_47\":48,\"_305\":339,\"_306\":10,\"_304\":14},\"exclusive_key\",\"files_source_fidelity\",\"rebase_developer_message\",[335],{},{\"_255\":339,\"_262\":353,\"_35\":354,\"_37\":355,\"_266\":356,\"_268\":269,\"_271\":272,\"_273\":357,\"_275\":276},\"dc453efa-f51d-4e79-b6f1-8b55af7da17b\",[326],{\"_322\":376,\"_273\":377},1785742066.094614,1785742072.853072,{\"_317\":31