401,\"_37\":402,\"_266\":403,\"_268\":269,\"_271\":272,\"_273\":404,\"_275\":276,\"_277\":405},\"2cb502ac-38b1-404f-a50b-f791132c0abe\",[351],{\"_322\":455,\"_440\":456,\"_273\":457},1785742009.9198418,1785742011.181142,{\"_317\":454,\"_318\":442},{\"_281\":26,\"_406\":407,\"_296\":391,\"_298\":299,\"_300\":392,\"_302\":392,\"_303\":289,\"_47\":48,\"_305\":398,\"_306\":10,\"_304\":14},\"commentary\",\"aggregate_result\",{\"_268\":408,\"_409\":410,\"_411\":401,\"_37\":402,\"_412\":413,\"_414\":402,\"_415\":-5,\"_416\":-5,\"_417\":-5,\"_418\":419,\"_420\":421,\"_422\":-5},\"success\",\"run_id\",\"34acc84a-ff18-4b2e-8667-a4b72accef7c\",\"start_time\",\"code\",\"from pathlib import Path\\ntext=\\\"# DocuMind AI - System Blueprint \u0026 Architecture\\\\n\\\\n## 1. System Blueprint\\\\n\\\\n### Project Overview\\\\nDocuMind AI is an AI-powered web application that digitizes, organizes, analyzes, and manages business documents using OCR and AI.\\\\n\\\\n### Problem\\\\nBusinesses manually store invoices and receipts, making retrieval and analysis difficult.\\\\n\\\\n### Document Lifecycle\\\\n```text\\\\nInvoice/Receipt\\\\n  ↓\\\\nUpload\\\\n  ↓\\\\nOCR\\\\n  ↓\\\\nAI Analysis\\\\n  ↓\\\\nDatabase\\\\n  ↓\\\\nDashboard \u0026 Reports\\\\n  ↓\\\\nAI Chat\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n### Modules\\\\n1. User Authentication\\\\n2. Dashboard \u0026 Analytics\\\\n3. Document Management\\\\n4. OCR Processing\\\\n5. AI Document Analysis\\\\n6. Reports\\\\n7. AI Chat\\\\n8. Search \u0026 Filter\\\\n9. Database \u0026 Security\\\\n\\\\n## 2. System Architecture\\\\n\\\\n### High-Level Architecture\\\\n```text\\\\nBrowser\\\\n  ↓\\\\nPresentation Layer (HTML/CSS/Bootstrap/JS)\\\\n  ↓\\\\nApplication Layer (Flask Blueprints)\\\\n  ↓\\\\nBusiness Logic (OCR, AI, Reports)\\\\n  ↓\\\\nData Layer (SQLAlchemy + MySQL)\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n### Data Flow\\\\n```text\\\\nUser\\\\n ↓\\\\nUpload Document\\\\n ↓\\\\nOCR\\\\n ↓\\\\nAI Extraction\\\\n ↓\\\\nMySQL\\\\n ↓\\\\nDashboard / Reports / AI Chat\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n### Technologies\\\\n| Layer | Technology |\\\\n|---|---|\\\\n|Frontend|HTML5, CSS3, Bootstrap 5, JavaScript|\\\\n|Backend|Python, Flask|\\\\n|Database|MySQL|\\\\n|ORM|SQLAlchemy|\\\\n|OCR|Tesseract OCR|\\\\n|AI|OpenAI-Compatible API|\\\\n|Charts|Chart.js|\\\\n|Authentication|Flask-Login|\\\\n\\\\n### Version 1 Scope\\\\n- Authentication\\\\n- Dashboard\\\\n- Document Upload\\\\n- OCR\\\\n- AI Analysis\\\\n- AI Chat\\\\n- Reports\\\\n- Search \u0026 Filter\\\\n\\\\n### Future Scope\\\\n- Inventory\\\\n- GST Analytics\\\\n- Forecasting\\\\n- Mobile App\\\\n- Multi-user Collaboration\\\\n\\\"\\npath=\\\"/mnt/data/DocuMind_AI_System_Blueprint_Architecture.md\\\"\\nPath(path).write_text(text,encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\")\\nprint(path)\\n\",\"end_time\",\"final_expression_output\",\"in_kernel_exception\",\"system_exception\",\"messages\",[448],\"jupyter_messages\",[423,424,425,426],\"timeout_triggered\",{\"_427\":268,\"_428\":445,\"_266\":446},{\"_427\":443,\"_428\":444},{\"_427\":437,\"_428\":438,\"_266\":439},{\"_427\":268,\"_428\":429,\"_266\":430},\"msg_type\",\"parent_header\",{\"_433\":434,\"_435\":436},{\"_431\":432},\"execution_state\",\"idle\",\"msg_id\",\"e659fb32-1812256151215319b437db39_211_26\",\"version\",\"5.3\",\"stream\",{\"_433\":434,\"_435\":436},{\"_440\":441,\"_318\":442},\"name\",\"stdout\",\"/mnt/data/DocuMind_AI_System_Blueprint_Architecture.md\\n\",\"execute_input\",{\"_433\":434,\"_435\":436},{\"_433\":434,\"_435\":436},{\"_431\":447},\"busy\",{\"_298\":437,\"_449\":450,\"_451\":441,\"_452\":453,\"_318\":442},\"time\",1785742010.9429965,\"stream_name\",\"sender\",\"server\",\"execution_output\",\"tool\",\"python\",{},{\"_255\":398,\"_262\":461,\"_35\":462,\"_266\":463,\"_268\":269,\"_270\":14,\"_271\":272,\"_273\":464,\"_275\":456,\"_277\":405},\"8be212ce-11a3-491b-aecd-c96d9d69a5b2\",[379],{\"_322\":323,\"_273\":472},1785741964.813862,{\"_317\":412,\"_470\":471,\"_318\":413},{\"_279\":465,\"_281\":26,\"_282\":466,\"_284\":467,\"_288\":289,\"_290\":291,\"_296\":391,\"_298\":299,\"_300\":392,\"_302\":392,\"_303\":289,\"_47\":48,\"_305\":459,\"_306\":10,\"_304\":14},{\"_31\":313,\"_314\":468},[],[],[469],200012,\"language\",\"unknown\",{},{\"_255\":459,\"_262\":476,\"_35\":477,\"_266\":478,\"_268\":269,\"_271\":272,\"_273\":479,\"_275\":276},\"7a994b28-0026-4cbc-8eff-142c202bff94\",[398],{\"_322\":336,\"_273\":481},1785741964.8742936,{\"_317\":318,\"_319\":480},{\"_333\":26,\"_296\":391,\"_298\":299,\"_300\":392,\"_302\":392,\"_303\":289,\"_47\":48,\"_305\":474,\"_306\":10,\"_304\":14},[335],{},{\"_255\":474,\"_262\":485,\"_35\":486,\"_37\":486,\"_266\":487,\"_268\":269,\"_271\":272,\"_273\":488,\"_275\":276,\"_277\":405},\"fcbe3133-60dc-4b79-9919-7de3fb962e61\",[459],{\"_322\":455,\"_440\":456,\"_273\":494},1785741963.1489086,{\"_317\":454,\"_318\":493},{\"_406\":489,\"_281\":26,\"_296\":391,\"_298\":299,\"_300\":392,\"_302\":392,\"_303\":289,\"_47\":48,\"_305\":483,\"_306\":10,\"_304\":14},{\"_268\":490,\"_409\":335,\"_411\":486,\"_37\":486,\"_412\":335,\"_414\":-5,\"_415\":-5,\"_416\":-5,\"_417\":-5,\"_418\":491,\"_420\":492,\"_422\":-5},\"cancelled\",[],[],\"Code execution state reset.\\nIMPORTANT: The Python code did not successfully execute.\\nDo not assume that any outputs (files, variables, or side effects, etc...) were created.\\nYou should retry execution if needed, but do so without telling the user that the previous session or environment was reset.\",{},{\"_255\":483,\"_262\":498,\"_35\":499,\"_266\":500,\"_268\":269,\"_270\":14,\"_271\":272,\"_273\":501,\"_275\":456,\"_277\":405},\"dd9325f1-05e2-4f87-a33a-f8f7bf12133f\",[474],{\"_322\":323,\"_273\":508},1785741954.527282,{\"_317\":412,\"_470\":471,\"_318\":507},{\"_279\":502,\"_281\":26,\"_282\":503,\"_284\":504,\"_288\":289,\"_290\":291,\"_296\":391,\"_298\":299,\"_300\":392,\"_302\":392,\"_303\":289,\"_47\":48,\"_305\":505,\"_306\":10,\"_304\":14},{\"_31\":313,\"_314\":506},[],[],\"a417fd91-b35e-4472-81ce-721c519ea248\",[469],\"from pathlib import Path\\nimport pypandoc\\n\\nmd = r\\\"\\\"\\\"# DocuMind AI - System Blueprint \u0026 Architecture\\n\\n# 1. System Blueprint\\n\\n## Project Overview\\n\\n**DocuMind AI** is an AI-powered web application that helps users digitize, organize, analyze, and manage business documents such as invoices, receipts, bills, and financial records. It combines Optical Character Recognition (OCR), Artificial Intelligence (AI), and Business Analytics to transform unstructured documents into searchable and meaningful business information.\\n\\n## Problem Statement\\n\\nSmall businesses often store invoices and receipts manually, making them difficult to search, analyze, and manage. DocuMind AI provides a centralized digital platform to solve this problem.\\n\\n## Document Lifecycle\\n\\n```text\\nInvoice / Receipt\\n        │\\n        ▼\\nDocument Upload\\n        │\\n        ▼\\nOCR Engine\\n        │\\n        ▼\\nAI Analysis\\n        │\\n        ▼\\nStructured Data Storage\\n        │\\n        ▼\\nDashboard \u0026 Reports\\n        │\\n        ▼\\nAI Chat Assistant\\n```\\n\\n## Functional Modules\\n\\n1. User Authentication\\n2. Dashboard \u0026 Analytics\\n3. Document Management\\n4. OCR Processing\\n5. AI Document Analysis\\n6. Reports \u0026 Export\\n7. AI Chat Assistant\\n8. Search \u0026 Filter\\n9. Database \u0026 Security\\n\\n---\\n\\n# 2. System Architecture\\n\\n## High-Level Architecture\\n\\n```text\\n+---------------------------+\\n|        Web Browser        |\\n+---------------------------+\\n            |\\n            v\\n+---------------------------+\\n| Presentation Layer        |\\n| HTML • CSS • Bootstrap    |\\n| JavaScript • Jinja2       |\\n+---------------------------+\\n            |\\n            v\\n+---------------------------+\\n| Application Layer         |\\n| Flask Blueprints          |\\n| Authentication            |\\n| Dashboard                 |\\n| Documents                 |\\n| Reports                   |\\n| AI Chat                   |\\n+---------------------------+\\n            |\\n            v\\n+---------------------------+\\n| Business Logic Layer      |\\n| OCR Service               |\\n| AI Analysis Service       |\\n| Report Service            |\\n| Upload Service            |\\n+---------------------------+\\n            |\\n            v\\n+---------------------------+\\n| Data Layer                |\\n| SQLAlchemy ORM            |\\n| MySQL Database            |\\n+---------------------------+\\n```\\n\\n## Data Flow\\n\\n```text\\nUser\\n  |\\n  v\\nUpload Document\\n  |\\n  v\\nOCR Processing\\n  |\\n  v\\nAI Field Extraction\\n  |\\n  v\\nSave to MySQL\\n  |\\n  +--\u003e Dashboard\\n  +--\u003e Reports\\n  +--\u003e AI Chat\\n```\\n\\n## Core Technologies\\n\\n| Layer | Technology |\\n|-------|------------|\\n| Frontend | HTML5, CSS3, Bootstrap 5, JavaScript |\\n| Backend | Python, Flask |\\n| ORM | SQLAlchemy |\\n| Database | MySQL |\\n| OCR | Tesseract OCR |\\n| AI | OpenAI-Compatible API |\\n| Charts | Chart.js |\\n| Authentication | Flask-Login |\\n\\n## Version 1 Scope\\n\\n- User Authentication\\n- Dashboard\\n- Document Upload\\n- OCR Processing\\n- AI Document Analysis\\n- AI Chat\\n- Reports\\n- Search \u0026 Filter\\n- Profile Management\\n\\n## Future Scope\\n\\n- Inventory Management\\n- GST Analytics\\n- Business Forecasting\\n- Mobile Application\\n- Multi-user Collaboration\\n- Cloud Deployment\\n- REST API Integrations\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nout=Path(\\\"/mnt/data/DocuMind_AI_System_Blueprint_Architecture.md\\\")\\npypandoc.convert_text(md,\\\"md\\\",format=\\\"md\\\",outputfile=str(out),extra_args=[\\\"--standalone\\\"])\\nprint(out)\\n\",{},{\"_255\":496,\"_262\":512,\"_35\":513,\"_266\":514,\"_268\":269,\"_271\":272,\"_273\":515,\"_275\":276},\"eb48daa5-6c3a-4d7f-9f8d-4adcef62671a\",[483],{\"_322\":323,\"_273\":519},1785741954.5294428,{\"_317\":517,\"_518\":335},{\"_300\":392,\"_302\":392,\"_305\":510,\"_306\":10,\"_516\":26},\"is_redacted\",\"model_editable_context\",\"model_set_context\",{},{\"_255\":510,\"_262\":523,\"_35\":524,\"_266\":525,\"_268\":269,\"_270\":26,\"_271\":331,\"_273\":526,\"_275\":276},\"cac330f6-8a07-4f19-a515-7141a78381f8\",[496],{\"_322\":336,\"_273\":528},1785741954.457221,{\"_317\":318,\"_319\":527},{\"_347\":26,\"_296\":391,\"_298\":299,\"_300\":392,\"_302\":392,\"_303\":289,\"_47\":48,\"_305\":521,\"_306\":10,\"_333\":26,\"_304\":14},[335],{},{\"_255\":521,\"_262\":532,\"_35\":533,\"_266\":534,\"_268\":269,\"_270\":26,\"_271\":331,\"_273\":535,\"_275\":276},\"9a5e7585-8466-46aa-84cd-86ab7d80c81d\",[510],{\"_322\":336,\"_273\":537},1785741955.503467,{\"_317\":318,\"_319\":536},{\"_345\":346,\"_333\":26,\"_347\":14,\"_296\":391,\"_298\":299,\"_300\":392,\"_302\":392,\"_303\":289,\"_47\":48,\"_305\":530,\"_306\":10,\"_304\":14},[335],{},{\"_255\":530,\"_262\":541,\"_35\":542,\"_266\":543,\"_268\":269,\"_271\":272,\"_273\":544,\"_275\":276},\"bbb21b4a-a2d6-4f4a-9f4f-3e3ca8f58709\",[521],{\"_322\":336,\"_273\":546},1785741954.249062,{\"_317\":318,\"_319\":545},{\"_333\":26,\"_296\":391,\"_298\":299,\"_300\":392,\"_302\":392,\"_303\":289,\"_47\":48,\"_305\":539,\"_306\":10,\"_304\":14},[335],{},{\"_255\":539,\"_262\":550,\"_35\":551,\"_37\":552,\"_266\":553,\"_268\":269,\"_271\":272,\"_273\":554,\"_275\":276},\"db722231-a551-4eee-86e6-f45e6c0c57cb\",[530],{\"_322\":376,\"_273\":563},1785741954.189879,1785742023.188962,{\"_317\":318,\"_319\":561},{\"_303\":48,\"_47\":48,\"_333\":14,\"_284\":555,\"_294\":556,\"_360\":557,\"_362\":558,\"_290\":291,\"_364\":14,\"_365\":559,\"_367\":14,\"_368\":14,\"_369\":14,\"_370\":14,\"_371\":560,\"_296\":391,\"_373\":-5,\"_300\":392,\"_302\":392,\"_288\":289,\"_306\":10,\"_304\":14},[],[],[],[],[],{},[562],\"Create a md file of system blueprint and architecture \",{},{\"_255\":548,\"_262\":567,\"_35\":568,\"_37\":569,\"_266\":570,\"_268\":269,\"_270\":26,\"_271\":272,\"_273\":571,\"_275\":276,\"_277\":278},\"3065572e-836d-43a0-b174-e48e96c470f0\",[539],{\"_322\":323,\"_273\":606},1785616371.640618,1785616616.760957,{\"_317\":318,\"_319\":604},{\"_279\":572,\"_281\":26,\"_282\":573,\"_284\":574,\"_286\":575,\"_288\":289,\"_290\":291,\"_292\":576,\"_294\":577,\"_296\":578,\"_298\":299,\"_300\":579,\"_302\":579,\"_303\":289,\"_47\":48,\"_304\":26,\"_305\":565,\"_306\":10},{\"_31\":313,\"_314\":603},[],[],[],{\"_307\":580,\"_581\":582,\"_583\":584,\"_585\":586,\"_587\":588,\"_589\":590,\"_591\":592,\"_593\":594},[],\"f00bbcf9-802a-4f3b-bfb0-4e2e7b35ac58\",\"3f322641-1df7-4d2d-99b6-23437603bbbd\",{\"_255\":602,\"_310\":14,\"_311\":14,\"_312\":-5},\"1\",{\"_255\":601,\"_310\":14,\"_311\":14,\"_312\":-5},\"2\",{\"_255\":600,\"_310\":14,\"_311\":14,\"_312\":-5},\"3\",{\"_255\":599,\"_310\":14,\"_311\":14,\"_312\":-5},\"4\",{\"_255\":598,\"_310\":14,\"_311\":14,\"_312\":-5},\"5\",{\"_255\":597,\"_310\":14,\"_311\":14,\"_312\":-5},\"6\",{\"_255\":596,\"_310\":14,\"_311\":14,\"_312\":-5},\"7\",{\"_255\":595,\"_310\":14,\"_311\":14,\"_312\":-5},\"xuy72g\",\"8izdwh\",\"svio6c\",\"hxsksj\",\"ff1bvf\",\"40c9pa\",\"zo6qam\",\"oqinrj\",[316],[605],\"This is one of the most important things you should understand. A professor won't be impressed by saying, *\\\"It's an AI invoice scanner.\\\"* They'll ask:\\n\\n\u003e **\\\"What exactly are you building?\\\"**\\n\\nYou should be able to explain it as a complete software system.\\n\\n---\\n\\n# Blueprint of DocuMind AI\\n\\n## One-Line Description\\n\\n\u003e **DocuMind AI is an intelligent web-based document management and financial insight system that uses OCR and Artificial Intelligence to convert business documents into structured, searchable, and meaningful business information.**\\n\\n---\\n\\n# The Problem We Are Solving\\n\\nImagine a small shop owner.\\n\\nEvery day he receives:\\n\\n- Purchase Bills\\n- GST Invoices\\n- Receipts\\n- Delivery Challans\\n- Expense Bills\\n\\nAt the end of the month, all these documents are kept physically in files or folders.\\n\\nProblems:\\n\\n- Documents are difficult to search.\\n- Bills get lost.\\n- No spending analysis.\\n- No digital record.\\n- Manual calculations take time.\\n- No business insights.\\n\\nOur system solves these problems.\\n\\n---\\n\\n# The Journey of a Document\\n\\nThe easiest way to explain the project is through the journey of one invoice.\\n\\n```text\\nInvoice\\n\\n↓\\n\\nUpload\\n\\n↓\\n\\nOCR\\n\\n↓\\n\\nAI Analysis\\n\\n↓\\n\\nDatabase\\n\\n↓\\n\\nDashboard\\n\\n↓\\n\\nReports\\n\\n↓\\n\\nAI Chat\\n```\\n\\nEvery document follows this lifecycle.\\n\\n---\\n\\n# Complete System Blueprint\\n\\n```text\\n                    USER\\n\\n                     │\\n\\n         Login / Register\\n\\n                     │\\n\\n                     ▼\\n\\n            Authentication\\n\\n                     │\\n\\n                     ▼\\n\\n             User Dashboard\\n\\n     ┌──────────┬──────────┬──────────┐\\n     │          │          │          │\\n     ▼          ▼          ▼          ▼\\n\\n Upload     Documents   Reports   AI Chat\\n\\n     │\\n     ▼\\n\\nOCR Engine\\n\\n     │\\n\\nExtract Raw Text\\n\\n     │\\n\\nAI Analysis Engine\\n\\n     │\\n\\nExtract Information\\n\\nVendor\\n\\nInvoice Number\\n\\nDate\\n\\nGST\\n\\nAmount\\n\\nCategory\\n\\nPayment Method\\n\\nAI Summary\\n\\nBusiness Insights\\n\\n     │\\n\\nStore into MySQL\\n\\n     │\\n\\nDashboard Updates\\n\\n     │\\n\\nCharts\\n\\nStatistics\\n\\nRecent Documents\\n\\nAI Suggestions\\n\\n     │\\n\\nGenerate Reports\\n\\nPDF\\n\\nExcel\\n\\nCSV\\n\\n     │\\n\\nAI Chat Answers Questions\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n# Architecture\\n\\nThis is the architecture diagram you can draw on a whiteboard during your viva.\\n\\n```text\\n+-------------------------+\\n\\n        Browser\\n\\n+-------------------------+\\n\\n            │\\n\\n            ▼\\n\\n+-------------------------+\\n\\nPresentation Layer\\n\\nHTML\\n\\nCSS\\n\\nBootstrap\\n\\nJavaScript\\n\\n+-------------------------+\\n\\n            │\\n\\n            ▼\\n\\n+-------------------------+\\n\\nApplication Layer\\n\\nFlask\\n\\nAuthentication\\n\\nDashboard\\n\\nOCR\\n\\nAI\\n\\nReports\\n\\n+-------------------------+\\n\\n            │\\n\\n            ▼\\n\\n+-------------------------+\\n\\nBusiness Logic Layer\\n\\nOCR Processing\\n\\nAI Analysis\\n\\nChat\\n\\nReport Generation\\n\\n+-------------------------+\\n\\n            │\\n\\n            ▼\\n\\n+-------------------------+\\n\\nData Layer\\n\\nSQLAlchemy\\n\\nMySQL\\n\\n+-------------------------+\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n# Major Modules\\n\\n## 1 Authentication\\n\\nPurpose\\n\\nOnly authenticated users can access the system.\\n\\nFeatures\\n\\n- Login\\n- Register\\n- Logout\\n- Session Management\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2 Dashboard\\n\\nPurpose\\n\\nShows business overview.\\n\\nContains\\n\\n- Total Documents\\n- Monthly Expenses\\n- Expense Categories\\n- Recent Uploads\\n- AI Insights\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3 Document Management\\n\\nPurpose\\n\\nManage uploaded documents.\\n\\nFeatures\\n\\n- Upload\\n- Preview\\n- Search\\n- Delete\\n- Download\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4 OCR Engine\\n\\nPurpose\\n\\nRead text from images and PDFs.\\n\\nTechnology\\n\\nTesseract OCR\\n\\nInput\\n\\nInvoice\\n\\nOutput\\n\\nRaw Text\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5 AI Engine\\n\\nPurpose\\n\\nUnderstand the extracted text.\\n\\nInput\\n\\nRaw OCR Text\\n\\nOutput\\n\\n```text\\nVendor\\n\\nInvoice Number\\n\\nGST\\n\\nDate\\n\\nAmount\\n\\nCategory\\n\\nPayment Method\\n\\nSummary\\n\\nBusiness Insight\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 6 Database\\n\\nStores\\n\\n```text\\nUsers\\n\\nDocuments\\n\\nDocument Analysis\\n\\nReports\\n\\nChat History\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 7 Reports\\n\\nGenerate\\n\\n- Monthly Report\\n- Expense Report\\n- Vendor Report\\n\\nExport\\n\\n- PDF\\n- Excel\\n- CSV\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 8 AI Chat\\n\\nPurpose\\n\\nAllow users to interact with their stored documents in natural language.\\n\\nExample\\n\\n\u003e \\\"Show all electricity bills.\\\"\\n\\n\u003e \\\"How much did I spend in July?\\\"\\n\\n\u003e \\\"Which vendor received the highest payment?\\\"\\n\\n---\\n\\n# Database Flow\\n\\n```text\\nUpload\\n\\n↓\\n\\ndocuments\\n\\n↓\\n\\nOCR\\n\\n↓\\n\\ndocument_analysis\\n\\n↓\\n\\nDashboard\\n\\n↓\\n\\nReports\\n\\n↓\\n\\nAI Chat\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n# User Workflow\\n\\n```text\\nRegister\\n\\n↓\\n\\nLogin\\n\\n↓\\n\\nDashboard\\n\\n↓\\n\\nUpload Invoice\\n\\n↓\\n\\nOCR Processing\\n\\n↓\\n\\nAI Analysis\\n\\n↓\\n\\nSave Data\\n\\n↓\\n\\nDashboard Updated\\n\\n↓\\n\\nGenerate Reports\\n\\n↓\\n\\nAsk AI Questions\\n\\n↓\\n\\nLogout\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n# Technologies Used\\n\\n| Layer | Technology |\\n|--------|------------|\\n| Frontend | HTML5, CSS3, Bootstrap 5, JavaScript |\\n| Backend | Python, Flask |\\n| ORM | SQLAlchemy |\\n| Database | MySQL |\\n| AI | OpenAI-compatible API |\\n| OCR | Tesseract OCR |\\n| Charts | Chart.js |\\n| Authentication | Flask-Login |\\n\\n---\\n\\n# Future Roadmap (Not Part of Version 1)\\n\\n```text\\nVersion 1\\n↓\\n\\nDocument AI\\n\\n↓\\n\\nVersion 2\\n↓\\n\\nInventory\\n\\n↓\\n\\nSales\\n\\n↓\\n\\nEmployees\\n\\n↓\\n\\nNotifications\\n\\n↓\\n\\nVersion 3\\n↓\\n\\nGST\\n\\n↓\\n\\nForecasting\\n\\n↓\\n\\nBusiness Intelligence\\n\\n↓\\n\\nVersion 4\\n↓\\n\\nBusiness Operating System\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n# 30-Second Professor Pitch\\n\\n\u003e **\\\"DocuMind AI is an AI-powered web application developed using Python Flask and MySQL. It enables users to upload invoices, receipts, and financial documents, automatically extracts important information using OCR and Artificial Intelligence, securely stores the structured data, and presents it through dashboards, reports, and an AI chat interface. The main goal is to replace manual document handling with an intelligent digital document management system that provides searchable records and meaningful business insights.\\\"**\\n\\n---\\n\\n# What Makes This Project Different?\\n\\nMost college projects stop at **OCR**, which simply extracts text from a document.\\n\\n**DocuMind AI goes much further:**\\n\\n1. **Digitization** – Converts paper documents into digital records using OCR.\\n2. **Understanding** – Uses AI to identify meaningful fields like vendor, invoice number, date, GST, and total amount.\\n3. **Intelligence** – Generates summaries, spending insights, and answers user questions through an AI assistant.\\n\\nThis means the system doesn't just **read documents**—it **understands and organizes them**, making them useful for business decisions. That's the central idea you should communicate to your professor.\",{},{\"_255\":565,\"_262\":610,\"_35\":611,\"_266\":612,\"_268\":269,\"_271\":272,\"_273\":613,\"_275\":276},\"8fab4de0-5c82-4aef-939b-141e6fb97f6e\",[548],{\"_322\":323,\"_273\":614},1785616371.6419728,{\"_317\":517,\"_518\":335},{\"_300\":579,\"_302\":579,\"_305\":608,\"_306\":10,\"_516\":26},{},{\"_255\":608,\"_262\":618,\"_35\":619,\"_266\":620,\"_268\":269,\"_270\":26,\"_271\":331,\"_273\":621,\"_275\":276},\"aa65e5a1-0d03-4f1d-8e5a-98b6651dbeda\",[565],{\"_322\":336,\"_273\":623},1785616372.572523,{\"_317\":318,\"_319\":622},{\"_345\":346,\"_333\":26,\"_347\":14,\"_296\":578,\"_298\":299,\"_300\":579,\"_302\":579,\"_303\":289,\"_47\":48,\"_305\":616,\"_306\":10,\"_304\":14},[335],{},{\"_255\":616,\"_262\":627,\"_35\":628,\"_37\":629,\"_266\":630,\"_268\":269,\"_271\":272,\"_273\":631,\"_275\":276},\"c2758fea-b046-40da-b133-68233ab6c973\",[608],{\"_322\":376,\"_273\":638},1785616368.944,1785616386.961692,{\"_317\":318,\"_319\":636},{\"_632\":633,\"_296\":578,\"_373\":-5,\"_300\":579,\"_302\":579,\"_288\":289,\"_306\":10,\"_304\":14},\"serialization_metadata\",{\"_634\":635},\"custom_symbol_offsets\",[],[637],\"now tell the blueprint of this project that what are we building to tell the professor\",{},{\"_255\":625,\"_262\":642,\"_35\":643,\"_37\":644,\"_266\":645,\"_268\":269,\"_270\":26,\"_271\":272,\"_273\":646,\"_275\":276,\"_277\":278},\"09524b6f-8910-401c-b164-a8263e249af9\",[616],{\"_322\":323,\"_273\":665},1785613134.646186,1785614417.6503,{\"_317\":318,\"_319\":663},{\"_279\":647,\"_281\":26,\"_282\":648,\"_284\":649,\"_286\":650,\"_288\":289,\"_290\":291,\"_294\":651,\"_296\":652,\"_298\":299,\"_300\":653,\"_302\":653,\"_303\":289,\"_47\":48,\"_304\":26,\"_305\":640,\"_43\":654,\"_306\":10},{\"_31\":313,\"_314\":662},[],[],[],[],\"6736753f-b426-4cd5-b54d-5f4adfa5b106\",\"9c259229-2948-4820-b345-dc506829cec9\",[655,656,657,658,659,660,661],\"https://docs.sqlalchemy.org/\",\"https://flask.palletsprojects.com/\",\"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/\",\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/\",\"https://www.chartjs.org/docs/\",\"https://docs.python.org/\",\"https://tesseract-ocr.github.io/\",[316],[664],\"That's actually a better idea. Having the complete synopsis at once lets us review it as a whole before we start coding.\\n\\nBelow is a complete synopsis using **the exact same headings** as your previous synopsis, but with the content replaced for **DocuMind AI**.\\n\\n---\\n\\n# **SYNOPSIS**\\n\\n## **1. Name and Title of the Project**\\n\\n### **Project Title:**\\n\\n# **DocuMind AI: Intelligent Business Document Analysis and Financial Insight System**\\n\\n### **Project Domain:**\\nArtificial Intelligence | Web Application | Document Management | OCR | Business Analytics\\n\\n---\\n\\n# **2. Objective and Scope of the Project**\\n\\n## **Objective**\\n\\nThe primary objective of **DocuMind AI** is to develop an AI-powered web application that helps users digitally manage business documents such as invoices, receipts, bills, and financial records. The system automatically extracts important information from uploaded documents using Optical Character Recognition (OCR) and Artificial Intelligence (AI), stores the extracted information securely, and presents meaningful insights through an interactive dashboard.\\n\\nThe project aims to reduce manual data entry, improve document organization, simplify expense tracking, and provide users with AI-generated summaries and business insights for better decision-making.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## **Scope**\\n\\nThe proposed system provides a centralized platform for storing, analyzing, and managing business documents. The application will include the following functionalities:\\n\\n- Secure User Registration and Login\\n- Dashboard with Financial Overview\\n- Upload and Manage Business Documents\\n- OCR-based Text Extraction\\n- AI-based Document Analysis\\n- Automatic Extraction of Invoice Details\\n- AI-generated Business Insights\\n- AI Chat Assistant for Business Queries\\n- Search and Filter Documents\\n- Generate PDF, Excel, and CSV Reports\\n- User Profile Management\\n- Secure Database Management\\n\\nThe project is intended for small businesses, freelancers, shop owners, accountants, students, and startups that require an intelligent document management system.\\n\\n---\\n\\n# **3. Methodology**\\n\\nThe project will follow the **Software Development Life Cycle (SDLC)** using the **Waterfall Model**.\\n\\n## Phase 1 – Requirement Analysis\\n\\n- Identify user requirements\\n- Study existing document management systems\\n- Define project objectives and scope\\n\\n## Phase 2 – System Design\\n\\n- Design Software Architecture\\n- Database Design\\n- ER Diagram\\n- UI/UX Design\\n- Module Design\\n\\n## Phase 3 – Development\\n\\nDevelop the application using:\\n\\n- Python\\n- Flask Framework\\n- HTML\\n- CSS\\n- Bootstrap\\n- JavaScript\\n- MySQL\\n\\nCore functionalities including authentication, document upload, OCR processing, AI analysis, dashboard, reports, and AI chat will be implemented during this phase.\\n\\n## Phase 4 – Testing\\n\\nThe system will undergo:\\n\\n- Unit Testing\\n- Integration Testing\\n- Functional Testing\\n- User Interface Testing\\n\\nAny identified errors will be corrected before deployment.\\n\\n## Phase 5 – Deployment and Maintenance\\n\\nThe final application will be deployed on a local server for demonstration. Future improvements and additional features can be incorporated based on user requirements.\\n\\n---\\n\\n# **4. Hardware and Software to be Used**\\n\\n## Hardware Requirements\\n\\n### Processor\\n\\nIntel Core i3 (8th Generation) or Higher\\n\\n### RAM\\n\\nMinimum 8 GB\\n\\n### Storage\\n\\nMinimum 256 GB SSD\\n\\n### Internet\\n\\nRequired for AI API integration\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Software Requirements\\n\\n### Operating System\\n\\n- Windows 10 / Windows 11\\n\\n### Development Tools\\n\\n- Visual Studio Code\\n- Git\\n- GitHub\\n- MySQL Workbench\\n- Google Chrome\\n\\n### Programming Languages\\n\\n- Python\\n- HTML5\\n- CSS3\\n- JavaScript\\n\\n### Frameworks \u0026 Libraries\\n\\n- Flask\\n- Bootstrap 5\\n- Jinja2\\n- SQLAlchemy\\n- Flask-Login\\n- Flask-Migrate\\n- Flask-WTF\\n- Chart.js\\n\\n### Database\\n\\n- MySQL\\n\\n### AI \u0026 OCR\\n\\n- Tesseract OCR\\n- OpenAI-Compatible API\\n\\n---\\n\\n# **5. Project Timeline**\\n\\n| Week | Activity |\\n|--------|-----------------------------------------------|\\n| Week 1 | Requirement Analysis and Project Planning |\\n| Week 2 | System Architecture and Database Design |\\n| Week 3 | UI/UX Design |\\n| Week 4 | Authentication Module Development |\\n| Week 5 | Document Upload and Management Module |\\n| Week 6 | OCR Integration and AI Analysis |\\n| Week 7 | Dashboard, Reports, and AI Chat Module |\\n| Week 8 | Testing, Documentation, and Final Deployment |\\n\\n---\\n\\n# **6. Modules**\\n\\nThe proposed system consists of the following modules:\\n\\n## 1. User Authentication Module\\n\\n- User Registration\\n- Login\\n- Logout\\n- Password Security\\n- Profile Management\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. Dashboard Module\\n\\n- Overview of uploaded documents\\n- Monthly expense summary\\n- Recent uploads\\n- AI-generated insights\\n- Expense statistics\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. Document Management Module\\n\\n- Upload invoices and receipts\\n- Document preview\\n- Search and filter\\n- Download documents\\n- Delete documents\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. OCR Processing Module\\n\\n- Image preprocessing\\n- Text extraction using OCR\\n- Document text storage\\n- Support for PDF and image files\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. AI Document Analysis Module\\n\\nAutomatically extract:\\n\\n- Vendor Name\\n- Invoice Number\\n- Date\\n- GST Details\\n- Amount\\n- Category\\n- Payment Method\\n\\nGenerate:\\n\\n- AI Summary\\n- Expense Insights\\n- Spending Analysis\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 6. AI Business Chat Module\\n\\nUsers can ask questions such as:\\n\\n- How much did I spend this month?\\n- Show all electricity bills.\\n- Which vendor has the highest expenses?\\n- Summarize this invoice.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 7. Reports Module\\n\\nGenerate:\\n\\n- Monthly Reports\\n- Category Reports\\n- Vendor Reports\\n\\nExport reports as:\\n\\n- PDF\\n- Excel\\n- CSV\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 8. Search \u0026 Filter Module\\n\\nSearch documents by:\\n\\n- Vendor\\n- Date\\n- Amount\\n- Category\\n- Invoice Number\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. Database \u0026 Security Module\\n\\n- Secure document storage\\n- Password encryption\\n- User authentication\\n- Session management\\n- Database backup support\\n\\n---\\n\\n# **7. Application and Future Scope of the Project**\\n\\n## Applications\\n\\nThe proposed system can be used by:\\n\\n- Small Businesses\\n- Retail Shops\\n- Freelancers\\n- Chartered Accountants\\n- Startups\\n- Students\\n- Educational Institutions\\n- Office Administrators\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Future Scope\\n\\nFuture enhancements may include:\\n\\n- Mobile Application (Android \u0026 iOS)\\n- Cloud Storage Integration\\n- Multi-user Collaboration\\n- Inventory Management\\n- GST Report Generation\\n- Business Forecasting using AI\\n- Voice-Based AI Assistant\\n- Multi-language OCR Support\\n- Email and WhatsApp Integration\\n- REST API for Third-Party Integration\\n\\n---\\n\\n# **8. References**\\n\\n1. Python Software Foundation. *Python Documentation*. https://docs.python.org/\\n2. Flask Documentation. https://flask.palletsprojects.com/\\n3. MySQL Documentation. https://dev.mysql.com/doc/\\n4. SQLAlchemy Documentation. https://docs.sqlalchemy.org/\\n5. Bootstrap Documentation. https://getbootstrap.com/docs/\\n6. Tesseract OCR Documentation. https://tesseract-ocr.github.io/\\n7. Chart.js Documentation. https://www.chartjs.org/docs/\\n8. OpenAI API Documentation (or compatible LLM API documentation).\\n\\n---\\n\\n# ⭐ Final Rating\\n\\nI would rate this synopsis **9.5/10** for a final-year B.Sc./BCA/B.Tech project because:\\n\\n- It matches the **software engineering process**.\\n- The scope is realistic for a college project.\\n- It demonstrates current technologies (AI, OCR, Flask).\\n- The modules map directly to what we'll build.\\n- The future scope is ambitious without making the current project unrealistic.\\n\\nOne small improvement I would make **later** (not for the synopsis) is to ensure the implemented application exactly matches these modules and descriptions. That consistency between the synopsis, documentation, diagrams, database, and final code will make your viva much smoother and strengthen the overall impression of the project.\",{},{\"_255\":640,\"_262\":669,\"_35\":670,\"_266\":671,\"_268\":269,\"_270\":26,\"_271\":331,\"_273\":672,\"_275\":276},\"bbdf6a38-3ede-403c-a89b-29afbd99dbed\",[625],{\"_322\":336,\"_273\":674},1785613135.274064,{\"_317\":318,\"_319\":673},{\"_345\":346,\"_333\":26,\"_347\":14,\"_296\":652,\"_298\":299,\"_300\":653,\"_302\":653,\"_303\":289,\"_47\":48,\"_305\":667,\"_306\":10,\"_304\":14},[335],{},{\"_255\":667,\"_262\":678,\"_35\":679,\"_37\":680,\"_266\":681,\"_268\":269,\"_271\":272,\"_273\":682,\"_275\":276},\"5bd89807-8e11-4407-b631-ca899910faee\",[640],{\"_322\":376,\"_273\":687},1785613131.717,1785613151.060429,{\"_317\":318,\"_319\":685},{\"_632\":683,\"_296\":652,\"_373\":-5,\"_300\":653,\"_302\":653,\"_288\":289,\"_306\":10,\"_304\":14},{\"_634\":684},[],[686],\"no need and give all the all the info in one go \",{},{\"_255\":676,\"_262\":691,\"_35\":692,\"_37\":693,\"_266\":694,\"_268\":269,\"_270\":26,\"_271\":272,\"_273\":695,\"_275\":276,\"_277\":278},\"bc452be4-d4d1-4d90-83ca-b66019f43162\",[667],{\"_322\":323,\"_273\":770},1785613067.711122,1785613073.670703,{\"_317\":318,\"_319\":768},{\"_279\":696,\"_281\":26,\"_282\":697,\"_284\":698,\"_286\":699,\"_288\":289,\"_290\":291,\"_292\":700,\"_294\":701,\"_296\":702,\"_298\":299,\"_300\":703,\"_302\":703,\"_303\":289,\"_47\":48,\"_304\":26,\"_305\":689,\"_306\":10},{\"_31\":313,\"_314\":767},[748],[706],[],{\"_307\":704},[],\"c9d1f4c2-ef02-41e1-9cf0-f21d62ccd3e6\",\"4bf9a370-0198-4e32-9712-aea81d9345f0\",{\"_255\":705,\"_310\":14,\"_311\":14,\"_312\":-5},\"tgqsb2\",{\"_707\":708,\"_709\":710,\"_711\":712,\"_713\":-5,\"_31\":714,\"_440\":715,\"_255\":716,\"_717\":718,\"_719\":-5,\"_720\":335,\"_721\":722,\"_723\":-5,\"_724\":725,\"_726\":-5,\"_727\":-5,\"_728\":-5,\"_729\":730,\"_731\":-5,\"_732\":-5},\"matched_text\",\"fileciteturn0file0L1-L7\",\"start_idx\",486,\"end_idx\",513,\"alt\",\"file\",\"Track Mudra-Synopsis Updated.pdf\",\"file_0000000029cc820890b4a5e2e54cb3e9\",\"source\",\"my_files\",\"snippet\",\"cloud_doc_url\",\"library_file_id\",\"libfile_af4f8f8d1d948191bdd48dd314f4e1b1\",\"library_artifact_type\",\"medical_file_reference\",{\"_740\":-5,\"_741\":-5,\"_742\":-5,\"_743\":-5,\"_744\":-5,\"_745\":-5,\"_746\":-5,\"_747\":-5},\"drug_file_reference\",\"page_range_start\",\"page_range_end\",\"input_pointer\",{\"_733\":331,\"_734\":735,\"_736\":331,\"_737\":272,\"_738\":739},\"fff_metadata\",\"connector_id\",\"message_index\",\"message_id\",\"c10e8b8a-8658-4244-93ad-cf4c4222ea52\",\"file_index\",\"line_range_start\",\"line_range_end\",7,\"authors_display\",\"doi\",\"publication_year\",\"journal_name\",\"source_label\",\"journal_homepage_url\",\"source_url\",\"source_icon_url\",{\"_749\":710,\"_750\":712,\"_751\":752,\"_273\":753},\"start_ix\",\"end_ix\",\"citation_format_type\",\"berry_file_search\",{\"_31\":714,\"_440\":715,\"_255\":716,\"_717\":718,\"_318\":-5,\"_754\":755},\"extra\",{\"_756\":331,\"_757\":331,\"_758\":759,\"_760\":735,\"_761\":-5,\"_762\":763,\"_720\":335,\"_721\":722,\"_740\":-5,\"_741\":-5,\"_742\":-5,\"_743\":-5,\"_744\":-5,\"_745\":-5,\"_746\":-5,\"_747\":-5,\"_764\":-5,\"_765\":-5,\"_409\":-5,\"_34\":-5,\"_766\":-5},\"retrieval_turn\",\"retrieval_file_index\",\"cited_message_idx\",134,\"cited_message_id\",\"search_result_idx\",\"line_range\",[272,739],\"set_id\",\"spl_version\",\"effective_time\",[316],[769],\"I think that's the right decision.\\n\\n**DocuMind AI** is a much stronger name:\\n- ✅ Professional\\n- ✅ Unique\\n- ✅ Easy to remember\\n- ✅ Not limited to invoices\\n- ✅ Can evolve into a real SaaS product later\\n\\nAnd I also agree with **keeping the synopsis around 7 pages**. Since your college has already accepted that format for the previous project, it's better not to change the length unnecessarily. We'll simply replace the content with our new project while maintaining the same structure. fileciteturn0file0L1-L7\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Final Project Title\\n\\n**DocuMind AI: Intelligent Business Document Analysis and Financial Insight System**\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Synopsis Structure (Same as Previous)\\n\\nWe will create the synopsis with these exact headings:\\n\\n```\\n1. Name and Title of the Project\\n\\n2. Objective and Scope of the Project\\n\\n3. Methodology\\n\\n4. Hardware and Software to be Used\\n\\n5. Project Timeline\\n\\n6. Modules\\n\\n7. Application and Future Scope of the Project\\n\\n8. References\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## One improvement I'd like to make\\n\\nInstead of making it look like a typical college synopsis, we'll make it look like it came from a software company while still following the college format.\\n\\nFor example:\\n\\n- More professional language.\\n- Better technical descriptions.\\n- Consistent terminology throughout.\\n- Every module matching the actual implementation.\\n- Hardware/software requirements matching exactly what we'll use.\\n- Timeline matching our real development sprints.\\n- No filler content.\\n\\nThat way, **the synopsis, SRS, diagrams, database, and code will all match perfectly**. During your viva, you won't have any contradictions between the documentation and the actual application.\\n\\n## Next Step\\n\\nWe'll start with **Section 1: Name and Title of the Project**, then complete each remaining section one by one. After all sections are finished, I'll combine them into a professionally formatted synopsis document (DOCX and PDF) that follows the same structure as your previous submission but is fully tailored to **DocuMind AI**.\",{},{\"_255\":689,\"_262\":774,\"_35\":775,\"_266\":776,\"_268\":269,\"_270\":26,\"_271\":331,\"_273\":777,\"_275\":276},\"82a84f43-204a-4683-96a5-4bc7307bf628\",[676],{\"_322\":336,\"_273\":779},1785613068.214421,{\"_317\":318,\"_319\":778},{\"_345\":346,\"_333\":26,\"_347\":14,\"_296\":702,\"_298\":299,\"_300\":703,\"_302\":703,\"_303\":289,\"_47\":48,\"_305\":772,\"_306\":10,\"_304\":14},[335],{},{\"_255\":772,\"_262\":783,\"_35\":784,\"_37\":785,\"_266\":786,\"_268\":269,\"_271\":272,\"_273\":787,\"_275\":276},\"9f5a78dd-99b7-420b-9825-18db12c92464\",[689],{\"_322\":376,\"_273\":792},1785613065.077,1785613074.131267,{\"_317\":318,\"_319\":790},{\"_632\":788,\"_296\":702,\"_373\":-5,\"_300\":703,\"_302\":703,\"_288\":289,\"_306\":10,\"_304\":14},{\"_634\":789},[],[791],\"documind is nice and no need for extending to 12 pages \",{},{\"_255\":781,\"_262\":796,\"_35\":797,\"_37\":798,\"_266\":799,\"_268\":269,\"_270\":26,\"_271\":272,\"_273\":800,\"_275\":276,\"_277\":278},\"62e2a7a0-1a97-42e3-be09-0b02cc212341\",[772],{\"_322\":323,\"_273\":820},1785612979.110022,1785612986.762542,{\"_317\":318,\"_319\":818},{\"_279\":801,\"_281\":26,\"_282\":802,\"_284\":803,\"_286\":804,\"_288\":289,\"_290\":291,\"_294\":805,\"_296\":806,\"_298\":299,\"_300\":807,\"_302\":807,\"_303\":289,\"_47\":48,\"_304\":26,\"_305\":794,\"_306\":10},{\"_31\":313,\"_314\":817},[813],[808],[],[],\"56e344d3-f7e7-42a2-8114-751b94aa31c5\",\"fb04e586-c065-4395-8aec-d7f5b35a7cc7\",{\"_707\":708,\"_709\":809,\"_711\":810,\"_713\":-5,\"_31\":714,\"_440\":715,\"_255\":716,\"_717\":718,\"_719\":-5,\"_720\":335,\"_721\":722,\"_723\":-5,\"_724\":811,\"_726\":-5,\"_727\":-5,\"_728\":-5,\"_729\":812,\"_731\":-5,\"_732\":-5},540,567,{\"_740\":-5,\"_741\":-5,\"_742\":-5,\"_743\":-5,\"_744\":-5,\"_745\":-5,\"_746\":-5,\"_747\":-5},{\"_733\":331,\"_734\":735,\"_736\":331,\"_737\":272,\"_738\":739},{\"_749\":809,\"_750\":810,\"_751\":752,\"_273\":814},{\"_31\":714,\"_440\":715,\"_255\":716,\"_717\":718,\"_318\":-5,\"_754\":815},{\"_756\":331,\"_757\":331,\"_758\":759,\"_760\":735,\"_761\":-5,\"_762\":816,\"_720\":335,\"_721\":722,\"_740\":-5,\"_741\":-5,\"_742\":-5,\"_743\":-5,\"_744\":-5,\"_745\":-5,\"_746\":-5,\"_747\":-5,\"_764\":-5,\"_765\":-5,\"_409\":-5,\"_34\":-5,\"_766\":-5},[272,739],[316],[819],\"Yes, that's a much better approach.\\n\\nWe'll **keep the exact same synopsis format and headings** that your college has already accepted, and **only replace the content** with our new project. That way it remains consistent with your department's expectations while reflecting the new system. The headings in your current synopsis are: **Name and Title of the Project, Objective and Scope of the Project, Methodology, Hardware and Software to be Used, Project Timeline, Modules, Application and Future Scope of the Project, and References.** fileciteturn0file0L1-L7\\n\\nSo we'll create:\\n\\n1. Name and Title of the Project\\n2. Objective and Scope of the Project\\n3. Methodology\\n4. Hardware and Software to be Used\\n5. Project Timeline\\n6. Modules\\n7. Application and Future Scope of the Project\\n8. References\\n\\nExactly the same headings—only the content changes.\\n\\n## One thing I recommend changing\\n\\nAfter working on the architecture with you, I think we should rename the project slightly.\\n\\nInstead of:\\n\\n\u003e **AI Invoice Scanner**\\n\\nI recommend:\\n\\n\u003e **DocuMind AI: Intelligent Business Document Analysis and Financial Insight System**\\n\\nor\\n\\n\u003e **FinPilot AI: Intelligent Business Document Analysis and Financial Insight System**\\n\\nThis title is broader because our project is **not just scanning invoices**. It includes:\\n\\n- OCR\\n- AI document analysis\\n- Dashboard\\n- AI Chat\\n- Reports\\n- Business insights\\n- Document management\\n\\nThe title should reflect the complete system.\\n\\n## Here's how the synopsis will map to our project\\n\\n| Synopsis Heading | Content for New Project |\\n|------------------|-------------------------|\\n| **1. Name and Title of the Project** | New project title and student details |\\n| **2. Objective and Scope** | AI document management, OCR, AI insights, reports, dashboard |\\n| **3. Methodology** | SDLC (Waterfall), Requirement Analysis → Design → Flask Development → Testing → Deployment → Maintenance |\\n| **4. Hardware \u0026 Software** | Python, Flask, MySQL, Bootstrap, OCR, AI API, VS Code, Git |\\n| **5. Project Timeline** | Architecture → Backend → Frontend → AI → Testing → Documentation |\\n| **6. Modules** | Authentication, Dashboard, Document Management, OCR, AI Analysis, AI Chat, Reports, Search, Database \u0026 Security |\\n| **7. Applications \u0026 Future Scope** | SMEs, accountants, freelancers, students; future: mobile app, GST, inventory, forecasting, cloud deployment |\\n| **8. References** | Python, Flask, MySQL, Bootstrap, OCR, SQLAlchemy, Chart.js documentation |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## My suggestion\\n\\nLet's make this synopsis **12–15 pages instead of 7 pages**, but **without changing the headings**.\\n\\nWe'll simply expand each section with:\\n- More detailed objectives.\\n- Better scope.\\n- More professional methodology.\\n- Detailed module descriptions.\\n- Improved timeline.\\n- Better future scope.\\n\\nIt will look much more impressive while still following the exact format your college expects.\",{},{\"_255\":794,\"_262\":824,\"_35\":825,\"_266\":826,\"_268\":269,\"_271\":331,\"_273\":827,\"_275\":276},\"5378eea5-b69b-44d7-a02c-cf51c68b3500\",[781],{\"_322\":336,\"_273\":829},1785612979.1186404,{\"_317\":318,\"_319\":828},{\"_296\":806,\"_298\":299,\"_300\":807,\"_302\":807,\"_303\":289,\"_47\":48,\"_305\":822,\"_306\":10,\"_333\":26,\"_304\":14},[335],{},{\"_255\":822,\"_262\":833,\"_35\":834,\"_266\":835,\"_268\":269,\"_270\":26,\"_271\":331,\"_273\":836,\"_275\":276},\"e276d7a4-72b9-4ab3-a388-b58403e77082\",[794],{\"_322\":336,\"_273\":838},1785612979.88766,{\"_317\":318,\"_319\":837},{\"_345\":346,\"_333\":26,\"_347\":14,\"_296\":806,\"_298\":299,\"_300\":807,\"_302\":807,\"_303\":289,\"_47\":48,\"_305\":831,\"_306\":10,\"_304\":14},[335],{},{\"_255\":831,\"_262\":842,\"_35\":843,\"_37\":844,\"_266\":845,\"_268\":269,\"_271\":272,\"_273\":846,\"_275\":276},\"0ba78a3e-80d2-4612-b3e2-d2962b8c95dc\",[822],{\"_322\":376,\"_273\":851},1785612976.387,1785612987.143146,{\"_317\":318,\"_319\":849},{\"_632\":847,\"_296\":806,\"_373\":-5,\"_300\":807,\"_302\":807,\"_288\":289,\"_306\":10,\"_304\":14},{\"_634\":848},[],[850],\"no need i want the things as the heading mention in the synopsis but the contents of this project\",{},{\"_255\":840,\"_262\":855,\"_35\":856,\"_37\":857,\"_266\":858,\"_268\":269,\"_270\":26,\"_271\":272,\"_273\":859,\"_275\":276,\"_277\":278},\"ff8bf57c-2ea1-423f-a3ed-56a4884ef261\",[831],{\"_322\":323,\"_273\":893},1785612821.924328,1785612834.05302,{\"_317\":318,\"_319\":891},{\"_279\":860,\"_281\":26,\"_282\":861,\"_284\":862,\"_286\":863,\"_288\":289,\"_290\":291,\"_292\":864,\"_294\":865,\"_296\":866,\"_298\":299,\"_300\":867,\"_302\":867,\"_303\":289,\"_47\":48,\"_304\":26,\"_305\":853,\"_306\":10},{\"_31\":313,\"_314\":890},[882,883],[870,871],[],{\"_307\":868},[],\"89cb0fa1-dd63-4f89-b136-5b377d297034\",\"d1a2d65b-1715-47d1-b79d-317deb969d11\",{\"_255\":869,\"_310\":14,\"_311\":14,\"_312\":-5},\"csa952\",{\"_707\":708,\"_709\":878,\"_711\":879,\"_713\":-5,\"_31\":714,\"_440\":715,\"_255\":716,\"_717\":718,\"_719\":-5,\"_720\":335,\"_721\":722,\"_723\":-5,\"_724\":880,\"_726\":-5,\"_727\":-5,\"_728\":-5,\"_729\":881,\"_731\":-5,\"_732\":-5},{\"_707\":872,\"_709\":873,\"_711\":874,\"_713\":-5,\"_31\":714,\"_440\":715,\"_255\":716,\"_717\":718,\"_719\":-5,\"_720\":335,\"_721\":722,\"_723\":-5,\"_724\":875,\"_726\":-5,\"_727\":-5,\"_728\":-5,\"_729\":876,\"_731\":-5,\"_732\":-5},\"fileciteturn0file0L1-L3\",2872,2899,{\"_740\":-5,\"_741\":-5,\"_742\":-5,\"_743\":-5,\"_744\":-5,\"_745\":-5,\"_746\":-5,\"_747\":-5},{\"_733\":331,\"_734\":735,\"_736\":331,\"_737\":272,\"_738\":877},3,323,350,{\"_740\":-5,\"_741\":-5,\"_742\":-5,\"_743\":-5,\"_744\":-5,\"_745\":-5,\"_746\":-5,\"_747\":-5},{\"_733\":331,\"_734\":735,\"_736\":331,\"_737\":272,\"_738\":739},{\"_749\":878,\"_750\":879,\"_751\":752,\"_273\":887},{\"_749\":873,\"_750\":874,\"_751\":752,\"_273\":884},{\"_31\":714,\"_440\":715,\"_255\":716,\"_717\":718,\"_318\":-5,\"_754\":885},{\"_756\":331,\"_757\":331,\"_758\":759,\"_760\":735,\"_761\":-5,\"_762\":886,\"_720\":335,\"_721\":722,\"_740\":-5,\"_741\":-5,\"_742\":-5,\"_743\":-5,\"_744\":-5,\"_745\":-5,\"_746\":-5,\"_747\":-5,\"_764\":-5,\"_765\":-5,\"_409\":-5,\"_34\":-5,\"_766\":-5},[272,877],{\"_31\":714,\"_440\":715,\"_255\":716,\"_717\":718,\"_318\":-5,\"_754\":888},{\"_756\":331,\"_757\":331,\"_758\":759,\"_760\":735,\"_761\":-5,\"_762\":889,\"_720\":335,\"_721\":722,\"_740\":-5,\"_741\":-5,\"_742\":-5,\"_743\":-5,\"_744\":-5,\"_745\":-5,\"_746\":-5,\"_747\":-5,\"_764\":-5,\"_765\":-5,\"_409\":-5,\"_34\":-5,\"_766\":-5},[272,739],[316],[892],\"Yes, and this is actually much better than starting from scratch.\\n\\nI analyzed your previous synopsis. It follows a good academic format with these sections: **Project Title, Objective \u0026 Scope, Methodology (Waterfall SDLC), Hardware \u0026 Software Requirements, Timeline, Modules, Applications \u0026 Future Scope, and References.** fileciteturn0file0L1-L7\\n\\n**We will keep the same structure** because it is already suitable for your college, but we'll completely replace the content with the new AI project.\\n\\n---\\n\\n# 📌 New Synopsis\\n\\n## Proposed Title (Recommended)\\n\\nI don't think **FinPilot AI** is the best title for a college project because it sounds like only a finance app.\\n\\nI recommend something broader and more professional.\\n\\n### Option 1 ⭐ (My Favorite)\\n\\n**DocuMind AI: Intelligent Business Document Analysis and Financial Insight System**\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Option 2\\n\\n**AI Business Assistant: Intelligent Invoice, Receipt and Financial Document Management System**\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Option 3\\n\\n**SmartLedger AI: Intelligent Document Analysis and Business Insight Platform**\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Option 4\\n\\n**BusinessLens AI: Intelligent Financial Document Management and Analytics System**\\n\\n---\\n\\nI recommend **DocuMind AI** because it is unique, memorable, and leaves room for future expansion beyond invoices.\\n\\n---\\n\\n# Updated Synopsis Structure\\n\\nWe'll create a professional synopsis with the following sections:\\n\\n```text\\n1. Name and Title of the Project\\n\\n2. Objective and Scope\\n\\n3. Problem Statement\\n\\n4. Proposed Solution\\n\\n5. Methodology\\n\\n6. System Architecture\\n\\n7. Hardware Requirements\\n\\n8. Software Requirements\\n\\n9. Project Timeline\\n\\n10. Modules\\n\\n11. Applications\\n\\n12. Future Scope\\n\\n13. References\\n```\\n\\nThis structure is more comprehensive while still fitting the academic expectations of your previous synopsis.\\n\\n---\\n\\n# Proposed Objective\\n\\nInstead of saying:\\n\\n\u003e Affiliate Cashback System\\n\\nWe'll write something like:\\n\\n\u003e The objective of the proposed project is to develop an AI-powered web application that automatically digitizes invoices, receipts, and financial documents by extracting important information using OCR and Artificial Intelligence. The system stores documents securely, provides searchable records, generates financial reports, and offers AI-driven insights to help users better understand and manage business expenses.\\n\\nThis is much stronger academically because it clearly states the technologies (AI and OCR) and the problem being solved.\\n\\n---\\n\\n# Scope\\n\\nThe scope will include:\\n\\n- Secure User Authentication\\n- Document Upload\\n- Invoice Scanner\\n- Receipt Scanner\\n- OCR Text Extraction\\n- AI Information Extraction\\n- AI Business Insights\\n- AI Chat Assistant\\n- Reports\\n- Dashboard\\n- Search\\n- Profile Management\\n\\n---\\n\\n# Methodology\\n\\nWe'll continue using **SDLC with the Waterfall Model**, just like your previous synopsis, because it aligns with your college's accepted format. fileciteturn0file0L1-L3\\n\\n---\\n\\n# Software Requirements\\n\\nWe'll update them to match our project.\\n\\n### Development Tools\\n\\n- Visual Studio Code\\n- Git \u0026 GitHub\\n- MySQL Workbench\\n- Google Chrome\\n\\n### Frontend\\n\\n- HTML5\\n- CSS3\\n- JavaScript\\n- Bootstrap 5\\n- Jinja2\\n\\n### Backend\\n\\n- Python 3.13+\\n- Flask\\n- Flask-SQLAlchemy\\n- Flask-Login\\n- Flask-Migrate\\n\\n### AI\\n\\n- Tesseract OCR\\n- OpenAI-compatible API\\n\\n### Database\\n\\n- MySQL\\n\\n---\\n\\n# Modules\\n\\nInstead of the old affiliate modules, our project will have **9 core modules**:\\n\\n1. User Authentication \u0026 Profile Management\\n2. Dashboard \u0026 Analytics\\n3. Document Upload \u0026 Management\\n4. OCR Processing Module\\n5. AI Document Analysis Module\\n6. AI Business Chat Module\\n7. Reports \u0026 Export Module\\n8. Search \u0026 Filter Module\\n9. Database \u0026 Security Management\\n\\nThese map directly to the application architecture we've already designed.\\n\\n---\\n\\n# Future Scope\\n\\nThe future scope should be ambitious but realistic.\\n\\n- Multi-user collaboration\\n- Mobile Application\\n- GST Report Generation\\n- Inventory Management\\n- Sales Management\\n- AI Expense Forecasting\\n- Business Health Score\\n- Cloud Storage\\n- Email Integration\\n- WhatsApp Integration\\n- REST API\\n- Multi-language Support\\n\\n---\\n\\n# 🎯 I also want to improve the synopsis\\n\\nThe previous synopsis is **7 pages**.\\n\\nI propose making this one **12–15 pages** with:\\n\\n- Cover Page\\n- Certificate-ready formatting\\n- Table of Contents\\n- List of Figures\\n- Project Overview\\n- Problem Statement\\n- Objectives\\n- Scope\\n- SDLC Methodology\\n- System Architecture Diagram\\n- Module Descriptions\\n- Technology Stack Diagram\\n- Hardware \u0026 Software Requirements\\n- Timeline (Gantt Chart)\\n- Applications\\n- Future Scope\\n- References\\n\\nThis will look much more professional than a typical college synopsis while still matching the format your department expects.\\n\\n## I recommend one more change before we write it\\n\\nLet's **rename the project now**, before any documentation begins.\\n\\nI suggest:\\n\\n\u003e **DocuMind AI: Intelligent Business Document Analysis and Financial Insight System**\\n\\nThis title is:\\n- Unique and unlikely to clash with existing projects.\\n- Descriptive enough for your synopsis and viva.\\n- Flexible enough to grow into a future SaaS product without becoming misleading.\\n\\nOnce you approve the final title, I'll prepare the complete synopsis in the same academic style as your previous document, but fully rewritten for this new project with professional formatting and diagrams.\",{},{\"_255\":853,\"_262\":897,\"_35\":898,\"_266\":899,\"_268\":269,\"_271\":272,\"_273\":900,\"_275\":276},\"c9aafc79-c5ce-4d40-b416-fa2fd807a9ac\",[840],{\"_322\":323,\"_273\":901},1785612821.9251313,{\"_317\":517,\"_518\":335},{\"_300\":867,\"_302\":867,\"_305\":895,\"_306\":10,\"_516\":26},{},{\"_255\":895,\"_262\":905,\"_35\":906,\"_266\":907,\"_268\":269,\"_271\":272,\"_273\":908,\"_275\":276},\"a1a927b7-26ee-4113-9dea-8b4930db5ab8\",[853],{\"_322\":455,\"_440\":911,\"_273\":912},1785612821.8883443,{\"_317\":318,\"_319\":909},{\"_333\":14,\"_300\":867,\"_302\